### 2. Data Models (Schemas)

#### [MODIFY] [schemas.py](file:///c:/Users/suvan/Desktop/AI%20+%20LLM%20+%20RAG/agentic-ai/src/models/schemas/schemas.py)
- **What it owns**: Define schemas for structured resume extraction:
  - `PersonalInfo`: Contact information (name, email, phone, location).
  - `Education`: School history (degree, major, institution, graduation_year).
  - `Experience`: Work history (job_title, company, duration, description).
